# The composer's hairline runs the WHOLE pane; the input is inset inside it.
#
# These are two halves of one shape and they were both wrong the same way. The
# composer bar carried its own horizontal padding, so the 1px rule that opens
# the strip was a child of the padded box and came out only as wide as the
# reading column — a 720px rule floating in an 820px pane, which reads as a
# card sitting on the transcript rather than as a footer under it. Puffin's
# `Divider()` is a SIBLING of the padded composer (AgentcloudChatView), so its
# rule spans the pane and only the content is inset. The fix moves the gutter
# off the bar and onto each content row, and there is no way to see from the
# code alone that it stayed moved: put the padding back on the bar and every
# other thing in the strip still looks right.
#
# The inset itself is the second half. Puffin centres a 768pt column
# (`AgentcloudTranscriptView.columnWidth`) and pads 12 inside it; hanabi had
# guessed 720 with no inset, which put every horizontal edge in the strip 12px
# in from the reference. At this window the pane is 820 wide, so the content is
# 820 - 2*((820-768)/2 + 12) = 744, and the input is that less the 19px send
# disc and its 9px gap.
#
# WHY LITERALS AND NOT ARITHMETIC: assert_ui compares against a number, and a
# number is the point — these are the measurements taken off
# docs/visual-parity/ref/01_home.png, scaled to this window's pane. A test that
# recomputed them from the same constants the view uses would pass whatever the
# view did.
#
# settings: {"window_width":1100,"window_height":760,"open_tabs":["t2"],"active_tab":"t2","theme":"dark"}

# The pane, for the numbers below to be read against.
assert_ui composer_divider x=280

# The rule: the full pane, not the reading column.
assert_ui composer_divider w=820

# The content: inset inside that rule, on Puffin's 768 + 12.
assert_ui composer_input_wrap x=318
assert_ui composer_input_wrap w=716

# 46, not 45: a 1px border draws ON the box edge, so 46 paints the 47 rows the
# reference's box paints (y=884 through y=930).
assert_ui composer_input_wrap h=46
